{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e5125d9f63d2947b","name":"Limited","source":{"id":"source:reference-e5125d9f63d2947b","title":"Limited","revision":18335,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:58:41Z","sha256":"80dacb2214b4cd5b776f47c9442bc299d902dc592522459ae3e35e324b76e321","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18335","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Limited&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e5125d9f63d2947b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The cost of a Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Locomotion System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Locomotion_System"}," can be reduced by placing limitations on its use. A Limited Locomotion System costs only one-tenth the normal cost. The Droid can only use this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Locomotion System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Locomotion_System"}," for a limited time. After using this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Locomotion System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Locomotion_System"}," for 1 round, the Droid must make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," check (DC 10 + 1 per check after the first) or it cannot use that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Locomotion System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Locomotion_System"}," again for 1 minute (10 rounds).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
